# 🌱 Climate Garden: Growing Solutions with Python

**Python Topic:** Variables
**Theme:** Gardening • Sustainability • Climate Action

```python
# 🌱 CLIMATE GARDEN
# Learning Python Variables through Gardening & Climate Action

print("🌱 WELCOME TO MY CLIMATE GARDEN 🌍")
print("=" * 50)

# ------------------------------------------------
# 1. Creating Variables
# ------------------------------------------------

garden_name = "Grow For Earth"

plants = 25
trees = 8
vegetable_beds = 4
water_saved = 120
compost_created = 15

favorite_tree = "Coconut"
favorite_fruit = "Starfruit"

climate_goal = "Restore nature through everyday gardening"

# ------------------------------------------------
# 2. Displaying Our Garden
# ------------------------------------------------

print("\n🌿 MY GARDEN")
print("-" * 50)

